  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>maintenance_assessment - sends each unprocessed maintenance log entry, with its asset's history, to the
assessment agent and writes the assessments to assessed_log.
Needs the agent running (agent-maintenance: python -m uvicorn agent.agent:app --port 8000) and
Ollama with llama3.2:3b. Empty assessed_log before a second run.

1. Read Log Entries: Table input, maintenance_log_db, the rows of maintenance_log WHERE processed =
   0, by logged_at.
2. Get Asset History: Database join, asset_history_db, the asset's history rows (asset_id = ?), at most 10,
   Outer join.
3. Sort rows: by log_id, then hist_logged_at, ascending.
4. Remove Duplicates: Unique rows on complete rows (asset_history.db stores each entry twice).
5. Aggregate History: Modified JavaScript value, history_json (String): the entry's history so far, as a JSON
   array.
6. Group by: groups log_id, asset_id, logged_at, engineer, log_text; history_json = Last non-null value.
7. Build Agent Payload: Modified JavaScript value, agent_payload (String): the JSON body for POST
   /assess.
8. Call Assessment Agent: REST client, POST ${AGENT_URL}/assess, Application type JSON, body
   agent_payload; agent_response, response_code, response_time_ms; ${STEP_COPIES} copies.
9. Check HTTP Status: Filter rows, response_code = 200; true to Parse Agent Response, false to Write
   HTTP Errors.
10. Parse Agent Response: Modified JavaScript value, priority, fault_type, pattern, assessment, confidence
    (Integer), parse_error, parse_error_msg.
11. Route by Priority: Switch / case on priority (String): CRITICAL, HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW to Write CRITICAL ...
    Write LOW; default Write MEDIUM.
12. Write CRITICAL, Write HIGH, Write MEDIUM, Write LOW: Table output, maintenance_log_db,
    assessed_log, 11 specified fields.
13. Write HTTP Errors: Text file output, ${Internal.Entry.Current.Directory}/http_errors.txt, every field of a
    failed call.

Connections: SQLite files in ../agent-maintenance/data, through ${Internal.Entry.Current.Directory}.
Parameters: AGENT_URL http://localhost:8000, STEP_COPIES 2.
Shipped data: 5 entries; Get Asset History writes 23 rows, Remove Duplicates 12, Group by 5; 5 rows into
assessed_log.</note>
      <xloc>80</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>629</width>
      <heigth>602</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
